    "description": "A total of 35 participants (15 males, 20 females) with ages ranging from 18 to 64 years (M = 25.6, SD = 9.11). The sample included 18 students (51.4%), 13 employed (40%), and 3 unemployed (8.7%). All participants were proficient in English and had near normal or corrected vision.",
