      "description": "Two distinct virtual reality environments: a 'curved room' and a 'rectangular room'. Both rooms were white, approximately 20 m² in floor area, and 2.8 m ceiling height. They featured identical office-like elements (wooden desk, black speaker, carpet, one door, one light) and a view of blue sky, trees, and greenery. The rectangular room had square windows and rectangular dimensions/corners. The curved room featured rounded walls, curved windows, and a dome-shaped ceiling.",
